WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:39.120
It's almost time.

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:40.740
Oh yeah. It's coming up soon.

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:44.410
Hey, what are you going to do about chocolates?

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:46.790
I think I'll make it myself this year.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:49.540
Valentine's Day only comes once a year.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.920
Sign says: Recommended Gifts for Valentine's Day.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:50.590
I wanna do it right!

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:53.800
But it'll probably be difficult to make chocolates on your own.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:54.880
You might not be able to do it.

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:55.720
I guess.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.260
Let's go buy some chocolate.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:07.230
Valentine's Day is Coming!
How to Make Your Own Chocolate.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:11.650
Magazine back says: Valentine's Day is Coming! Express Your Feelings with Handmade Chocolate.

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:13.190
I see. It's that time of year, after all.

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:18.990
An Exciting Present

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.410
Hey, what are you going to do for Valentine's Day?

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.370
Magazine front says: Valentine's Day is Coming!
How to Make Your Own Chocolate.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.370
Magazine back says: Valentine's Day is Coming!
Express Your Feelings with Handmade Chocolate.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.000
Go for it!

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:31.790
What a pain!

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:32.960
It's no good.

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:35.050
I'm always depressed this time of year.

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:36.260
Yeah.

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:40.550
We don't have any boyfriends, so Valentine's Day is pointless.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:43.140
Hey, who are you going to give your obligation chocolate to?

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:44.890
Are you going to give it to all the boys in our class?

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.180
Oh, geez!

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.310
Why don't you give a piece of chocolate to everyone?

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:52.060
That sounds too traumatic.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.650
It's all right.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:58.030
We can't expect anything in return.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:58.240
Note: They are referring to White Day, in March, when boys give presents to girls.

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:00.780
Valentine's Day, eh?

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:02.280
Yeah.

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:05.740
I wonder if Valentine's Day chocolates are sweet.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:07.910
I'm sure they are.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.580
Yeah.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.870
I wanna eat some.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.710
Sweet, sweet, lovely chocolate.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.170
Yeah.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.260
What's wrong, you two?

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:21.260
Leave them alone, Aoba!

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:23.180
Doujima-kun?

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:24.640
I can hear it.

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:29.980
They're wailing the lamentations of whipped dogs!

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:35.110
Well, I've never received any chocolates before, so...

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.320
H-H-HEY!

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.110
How dare you!

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:44.030
You're gonna get chocolates from Kasuga-san and Yayoi-san, aren't you?!

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:45.740
Hey! Cut it out!

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:48.040
I'll cook you alive!

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:49.290
Hey!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.710
Hold it, everyone!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:52.540
Stop it!

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:54.880
What are they up to?

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:56.790
Oh, Sayuri.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:57.590
Are you going home?

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.210
Yes. I have to go somewhere.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:04.090
Hey. What are you gonna do about Valentine's Day chocolate, Sayuri?

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:06.640
I wonder.

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:15.730
Amamiya's so fine!

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:16.770
Yeah.

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:21.240
If she gave me some chocolates, I'd be able to die without regrets.

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:26.320
Never mind that. I'm gonna die before that happens.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.950
There's a story behind that.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:34.670
The Legend of Amamiya Sayuri

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:34.670
Part 8

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.710
It happened over ten years ago.

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:42.510
There was a man who failed at his business and lost everything.

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:49.010
He lost all hope, became a drunkard, and was estranged from his family.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.520
He was frustrated every day.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.690
He decided to turn to crime.

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.860
But at that moment...

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:22.800
He received a chocolate from the young Amamiya-san, and the sweet chocolate returned him to his former self.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.880
He wept from the bottom of his heart.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:34.020
From that moment on, he put everything he had into his work,

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:39.150
and now he is a high-ranking member of a political party and a candidate for Prime Minister.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.020
Anyway...

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:42.610
Listen up.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:45.570
Just what is Sayuri to you?

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:46.450
Ayame!

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.030
What's your problem?

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:52.200
We're trying to tell future generations about how magnificent Amamiya-san is!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.660
Then let me tell you.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:58.420
Sayuri has never given anyone chocolates on
Valentine's Day. Not even obligation chocolates.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.420
R-Really?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.920
I wonder what she'll do this year.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:06.590
Will anyone be glad to get chocolates from Sayuri?

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:07.470
Tasty

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:11.800
Yeah. Okay.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.970
I'll go buy some soy sauce.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.270
Sale on Now!

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.140
Goodbye.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.020
I see.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:19.900
Amamiya-san's never given anyone chocolates before.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.110
Is this the place?

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:25.990
Cabbage

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:28.950
Let's see...

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:30.320
Where could it be?

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.960
Sign over Sayuri says: Valentine's Day Fair.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:44.590
Amamiya-san?

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:48.380
Is this all right?

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.630
This looks good.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.010
I'll get this.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:00.350
Let me see...

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:01.600
Now I need to get...

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.030
Huh?

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:12.660
Could she be...

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:16.660
I'll put these here.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.200
Hey, Riku.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:19.830
We need to talk.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:21.540
Later.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:24.250
Oh, Riku.

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.710
Did Riku come home?

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.300
Oh, darling.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:29.380
Yes, he's home.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.890
Isn't it time we told him?

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:41.730
She probably bought that chocolate to make something.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.480
I wonder who she's going to give it to.

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:50.070
Chocolate Cake For Dummies

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:55.410
It's no good!

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.950
I don't understand this at all!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.370
I don't know how to measure the ingredients!

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:03.080
Why is it so hard to make sweets?

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:06.420
How can I put these together and make a cake?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.670
Geez!

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.130
But still...

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:13.180
I went to all this trouble, and I want Riku-kun to eat something tasty...

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:16.890
Okay. I'll go ask Harinui-sensei!

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.560
Practice makes perfect!

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:21.270
With that decided, it's time for dinner!

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:22.730
Mom!

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.190
What's for dinner tonight?

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.240
I see.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.150
This is the finished product.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:37.740
How does it taste?

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.160
It's not too sweet.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.290
This should be just right.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:47.040
Zahha Tart

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:47.040
Chocolate Mousse Cake

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:47.040
Chocolate Cake

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:47.040
Not too sweet

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:52.590
I'll try lots of different recipes, and make a tasty chocolate cake for Riku-san.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:59.470
My... My love is...

00:08:59.470 --> 00:08:59.640
Milk Chocolate. Cocoa Powder. Fresh Cream.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:08:59.930
Valentine's Day is Coming! How to Make Your Own Chocolate. 780 yen.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:08.940
There.

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:14.400
Okay! Welcome, welcome!

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:18.120
How about some chocolate for Valentine's Day tomorrow?

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:24.410
They range from standard warehouse stock to premium world-class chocolates.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.750
There's obligation chocolate and chocolate for your
favorite boyfriend! There's chocolate for all occasions!

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.500
First come, first served!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.040
Onee-san! I'll take this please!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.000
Certainly!

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.510
I'll take 30 obligation chocolates!

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:35.510
Thanks for coming!

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:42.220
Hey. Kasuga-san.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:45.600
Huh? What's wrong, Harinui-sensei?

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.480
We have to turn the fire off. The chocolate's not ready yet.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.690
Huh? What a pain.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:55.740
At times like this, you have to put your feelings into it.

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.450
Right, Kasuga-san?

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.030
Right.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.660
Hey! Wait up, Mii-chan!

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.000
What's wrong, Mo-chan?

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:11.790
That's my line! Why are you in such a rush?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.210
That's because...

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:16.880
Never mind that.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.840
Let's go do some karaoke.

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:21.390
It's too lonely when I'm on my own.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:23.060
Well...

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:26.390
I have to get some things ready for tomorrow.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:27.520
So...

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:28.850
I'm so sorry!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:31.610
Oh yeah.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:32.560
Mi-chan...

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.240
I'll go ask senpai again!

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.570
It's so lively here today.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:41.710
I guess so.

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:44.740
Tomorrow is Valentine's Day.

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:47.580
Will I get chocolates this year too?

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:48.850
Here.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:51.830
What's this?

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:52.500
For me?

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.380
Is this chocolate?

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:03.340
Now don't misunderstand me, that is for always looking after me.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.220
Thank you, Hiyoko-kun.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.320
Amamiya-san?

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:23.740
What's up with her?

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:38.630
Signs says: Please Look After the Animals.

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:42.410
It would be so nice if she knows how you feel, Riku?

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:54.020
Yeah. Your hand-made chocolate really is amazing.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:54.770
It's good.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.490
Sakurai-kun...

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:08.080
But I would've liked it more if it were sweeter.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:08.950
I see.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:13.370
She's giving that chocolate to Sakurai-kun...

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:24.050
But I don't know what Aoba-kun would prefer.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:25.390
Geez.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.850
Sakurai-kun!

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:36.150
I'm home.

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:39.110
Oh. Welcome home, Riku.

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:40.320
Yeah.

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.110
Listen, Riku.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.700
We need to talk.

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.530
Does it have to be now?

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:48.120
Y-Yes.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.250
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.710
I'm Riku's mom.

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:57.710
I'm his dad.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.840
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.630
I'm Harinui Yuuko.

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:14.270
Good work!

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:15.730
Yeah. Good work.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.440
Ishiuchi-senpai.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.400
What's wrong, Shirakawa?

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:24.900
Here. Please accept this!

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:39.920
C-Could this be...

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.460
Yes. This is excitement.

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:44.300
Here you are, Kamino-san.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:46.340
Please accept this chocolate.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.970
This is the destiny of those who are beautiful.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:54.890
My beauty is to blame for this.

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.230
Oh! Beauty is...

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:03.400
I wonder if he'll accept this?

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:07.200
Hey! Pull yourself together.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:08.490
O-Outama-san.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.620
You'll be fine.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.030
You just need more self-confidence.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.410
Give him that chocolate.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.700
R-Right!

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:23.210
Heart says: To Inukai-senpai

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:27.800
Inukai-senpai.

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:30.390
Please accept this chocolate.

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:33.060
Oh. Thank you.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:38.060
Now I'm sleepy.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:43.360
But never mind that.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:45.150
Quit following me around.

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:46.570
You're annoying.

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:57.370
My love has left me for good this time!

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.500
He doesn't want anything to do with me!

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:01.920
There.

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:02.880
They're for you.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:04.920
Th-This is...

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:05.960
Could this be...

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:08.130
What else could it be? It's obligation chocolate.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:13.550
Finally! I finally got some chocolate!

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:14.850
Now I'm not a whipped dog anymore!

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:18.770
Those cost 10 yen each. They're so easy to please.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.020
Here. This is for you, Aoba-kun.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:23.860
Oh. Thank you.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.020
What's wrong?

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:27.360
You look depressed.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.900
I-It's nothing.

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:35.410
Wh-What'll I do?

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.040
I have to give this to him.

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.880
If I give it to him now, everyone will see me.

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:50.590
It might be a little embarrassing.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:52.970
B-But...

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:55.800
I might not have another opportunity.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.060
Riiiku-kuuuun!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:00.890
K-Kasuga-san!

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:01.770
What are you doing here?

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:05.020
Geez. I brought some chocolate with me. What else would I be doing?

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.860
Here. I made it myself.

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:09.900
All right. Just let me go.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:14.240
Oh. I'll never let you go until you eat it!

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.220
All I need to do is give it to him.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.300
Just like Ayame and the others did this morning.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:35.890
"Here. This is for you."

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:38.470
Okay.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:39.510
Riku-san.

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:46.770
Mina-chan.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:49.940
Riku-san. Please eat this.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.280
Sign says: Please Look After the Animals.

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:52.650
O-Okay.

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:53.780
Thank you.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.120
I tried to make it appeal to a grown-up's taste.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.420
DING-DONG-DANG-DONG!

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:11.880
You've all been waiting for this.

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:14.300
It's time for a Student Council Event!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:18.300
Naturally, today's target is Class 2-A's Aoba-kun!

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:21.970
Whoever catches him will receive premium chocolate from the Student Council!

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.520
NO WAY!

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:54.630
Sayuri?

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:13.900
I see. You must be lonely.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:16.900
Staff Room

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.160
Thanks for listening to me.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:19.880
What am I doing?

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:26.390
I went to the trouble of making this chocolate, so why can't I give it to him?

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.690
Those two are lucky.

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:35.940
They're so brave.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:40.450
That's not it.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.410
It's me. I'm hopeless.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:44.870
I'm such a coward.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:46.580
So...

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:53.630
If only I was braver...

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:47.760
Ummm...

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:49.100
I...

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:51.850
I...

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:53.480
I...

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:55.310
For you...

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:00.650
Why can't I finish this sentence?

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:04.700
At this rate, nothing will ever change.

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:06.070
But...

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:24.170
I'll be transferring to another school next month.

00:21:41.520 --> 00:21:44.860
I hope things go well with you and Sakurai-kun.

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:03.800
Aoba-kun is...

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:05.880
going away...

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:19.850
[Ending Song]

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:27.450
My heart is overflowing!

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:42.710
My heart is overflowing!Even if I try to conceal my feelings for you,

00:22:43.550 --> 00:22:48.590
I can't help blushing when our eyes meet.

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:57.310
I kept this a secret from my friends,

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:03.730
Because I didn't want to be teased.

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:13.070
The important thing that nobody knows,

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:20.210
I'll only tell to you.

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:25.000
These gently falling flower petals

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:28.590
are sneaking into my heart.

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:34.970
I want to make your heart flutter.

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:39.560
It's okay to have hopes

00:23:39.930 --> 00:23:43.230
for the future we await, right?

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:49.440
My heart is overflowing!

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:52.530
Next Episode Preview

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:52.410
I'm used to saying goodbye.

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:54.820
I've transferred between schools ever since I was little.

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:56.580
I thought that it was normal.

00:23:57.160 --> 00:24:02.960
But now that I've been here for a year, I believed, just for an instant, that these happy days would never end.

00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:05.960
However, now it's over.

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:11.010
I have to give her an answer. I have to tell her what this past year meant to me.

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:14.640
Next time on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:14.640 --> 00:24:15.890
An Exciting Farewell.

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:17.180
Please watch it.

00:24:17.360 --> 00:24:19.030
Farewell Riku.
